</ul>
<strong>Personal:</strong>

<ul>
	<li>Full Name: Andrew James Conrad</li>
	<li>Born: August 5, 2005</li>
	<li>Parents: Brian and Rachel Conrad</li>
	<li>Siblings: Will, Daniel </li>
	<li>Majoring in Business Administration</li>
